version:2.18.0 time20260112
1.Added:
(1) Added the following methods into "KeyManager" module:
      * "exportKey", which can be used to export targeted session key.
      * "injectPubKey", which can used for inject the public key information obtained from server.
(2) Added the following methods into "Crypto" module:
      * "createCryptogram", which can be used to concatenate the subsequent encrypted information blocks to be sent to the server.
      * "verifyCert", which can be used to specify the verification of external incoming certificate data for the certificate.
      * Refactor "encrypt" and "decrypt", on the basis of supporting the original encryption and decryption functions, the AES-GCM encryption and decryption function is also supported.
(3) Added "isSupportContactlessCard" to replace the ambiguity name of the "isSupportQuickPass" interface into "DeviceInfo" module.
(4) Added "ONLY_EXPAND" to specify the expansion procedure is used when deriving HKDF keys.
(5) Added "NAPIEMVL2UseExternalReader" to support specify whether to use external card reader in the EMV process.

2. Fixed:
(1) Fixed the issue with the N750P dual-magnetic-track device in "CardReader" module, when using cards in JISII magnetic track format, the problem occurred where the application failed to properly filter the 0x7E flag bit, resulting in abnormal data being obtained for the empty magnetic track.
(2) Add a delay within the "startOnlinePINEntry" and "startOnlinePINEntry" interfaces of the RNIB-related parameters, so that the "cancelPINEntry" function can quickly cancel the PIN entry process in "PINEntry" module.
(3) Add a delay within the loops of the "startOnlinePINEntry" and "startOfflinePINEntry" interfaces, so that the "cancelPINEntry" process can quickly cancel the PIN entry procedure in "PINEntry2" module.
(4) Fixed the issue where incorrect error codes -1121 (for too short listening) and -1141 (for too long listening) were not returned properly when the listening was enabled for too long or too short a duration in "PINEntry2" module.
(5) Fixed the issue of abnormal paper feeding quantity for S90 devices in the "feedPaper" interface in "Printer" module.


